<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>蔡奥琦｜个人简历</title>

  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      font-family:
        Inter,
        "PingFang SC",
        "Microsoft YaHei",
        sans-serif;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 10% 10%, rgba(91, 141, 239, 0.12), transparent 30%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 90% 20%, rgba(160, 99, 255, 0.10), transparent 30%),
        #f7f8fc;
      color: #1d2433;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    .container {
      width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 32px));
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 40px 0 70px;
    }

    .hero {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 0.8fr;
      gap: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .card {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.78);
      backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
      box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(40, 50, 80, 0.08);
      border-radius: 24px;
    }

    .intro {
      padding: 46px;
    }

    .label {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 8px 14px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: #eef3ff;
      color: #4c6fff;
      font-size: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(42px, 6vw, 72px);
      letter-spacing: -2px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .subtitle {
      font-size: 20px;
      color: #596174;
      line-height: 1.7;
      max-width: 700px;
    }

    .intro-actions {
      display: flex;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-top: 30px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .btn {
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 13px 20px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 600;
      transition: 0.2s ease;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background: #111827;
      color: white;
    }

    .btn-light {
      background: #f1f3f7;
      color: #20283a;
    }

    .btn:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .profile {
      padding: 32px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      min-height: 100%;
    }

    .avatar {
      width: 84px;
      height: 84px;
      border-radius: 22px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      font-size: 30px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: white;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #111827, #4f69ff);
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .profile h2 {
      font-size: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .profile p {
      color: #6a7284;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .status {
      margin-top: 28px;
      padding: 14px 16px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: #f7f8fb;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #4d5668;
    }

    .section-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .section {
      padding: 30px;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-size: 13px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1.8px;
      color: #8a93a4;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
    }

    .about {
      font-size: 17px;
      line-height: 1.9;
      color: #424a5c;
    }

    .tags {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .tag {
      padding: 10px 13px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: #f2f4f8;
      color: #394154;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .project-list {
      display: grid;
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .project {
      padding: 18px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      background: #f7f8fb;
    }

    .project strong {
      display: block;
      font-size: 17px;
      margin-bottom: 7px;
    }

    .project span {
      color: #747c8d;
      line-height: 1.6;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .timeline {
      display: grid;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .timeline-item {
      border-left: 2px solid #e3e6ee;
      padding-left: 18px;
    }

    .timeline-item strong {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .timeline-item span {
      color: #7a8293;
      line-height: 1.6;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .contact {
      padding: 30px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .contact h2 {
      font-size: 28px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .contact p {
      color: #757d8e;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      color: #9299a7;
      font-size: 13px;
      margin-top: 28px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 800px) {
      .hero,
      .section-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .intro {
        padding: 30px;
      }

      .profile,
      .section,
      .contact {
        padding: 24px;
      }

      .contact {
        align-items: flex-start;
        flex-direction: column;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: 46px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <main class="container">

    <section class="hero">
      <div class="card intro">
        <div class="label">PERSONAL PORTFOLIO</div>

        <h1>你好，我是蔡奥琦</h1>

        <p class="subtitle">
          专注于电商运营、AI 工具、自动化与软件产品设计。
          喜欢把复杂的事情做简单，把重复的事情交给自动化。
        </p>

        <div class="intro-actions">
          <a href="#projects" class="btn btn-primary">查看我的项目</a>
          <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-light">联系我</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="card profile">
        <div>
          <div class="avatar">蔡</div>

          <h2>蔡奥琦</h2>
          <p>
            电商运营 · AI 应用<br />
            自动化 · 产品设计
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="status">
          ● 当前正在持续开发个人工具与自动化项目
        </div>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section class="section-grid">
      <div class="card section">
        <div class="section-title">About Me</div>

        <p class="about">
          有电商运营、产品设计和自动化实践经验，
          熟悉 ChatGPT、飞书多维表格、RPA 等效率工具。
          注重实际落地，希望通过软件和自动化减少重复工作，
          提升个人与业务效率。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card section">
        <div class="section-title">Skills</div>

        <div class="tags">
          <span class="tag">电商运营</span>
          <span class="tag">AI 应用</span>
          <span class="tag">RPA 自动化</span>
          <span class="tag">ChatGPT</span>
          <span class="tag">飞书多维表格</span>
          <span class="tag">UI / 产品设计</span>
          <span class="tag">GitHub</span>
          <span class="tag">Vercel</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-grid" id="projects">
      <div class="card section">
        <div class="section-title">Projects</div>

        <div class="project-list">
          <div class="project">
            <strong>超级打印</strong>
            <span>
              面向日常办公场景的打印与文件处理工具，
              计划实现批量打印、任务管理等功能。
            </span>
          </div>

          <div class="project">
            <strong>融通金</strong>
            <span>
              贵金属行情看板与行情监控系统，
              主要用于白银实时行情、预警和数据展示。
            </span>
          </div>

          <div class="project">
            <strong>电商自动化系统</strong>
            <span>
              通过 RPA、表格与自动化流程，
              完成改价、数据统计和日报通知。
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card section">
        <div class="section-title">Experience</div>

        <div class="timeline">
          <div class="timeline-item">
            <strong>电商运营</strong>
            <span>
              商品管理、视觉设计、数据分析、
              广告投放与日常运营。
            </span>
          </div>

          <div class="timeline-item">
            <strong>自动化实践</strong>
            <span>
              使用 RPA、AI 与表格工具搭建自动执行流程。
            </span>
          </div>

          <div class="timeline-item">
            <strong>产品与工具开发</strong>
            <span>
              持续尝试将个人需求转化为实际可使用的软件工具。
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="card contact" id="contact">
      <div>
        <div class="section-title">Contact</div>

        <h2>保持联系</h2>

        <p>
          欢迎交流电商、AI、自动化和产品相关内容。
        </p>
      </div>

      <a href="mailto:your@email.com" class="btn btn-primary">
        联系我
      </a>
    </section>

    <footer>
      © 2026 蔡奥琦 · Personal Website
    </footer>

  </main>
</body>
</html>
